WEBVTT

00:02.070 --> 00:03.540
Morning.

00:21.610 --> 00:24.120
So which one are you right now?

00:25.130 --> 00:28.090
Aren't you...

00:28.090 --> 00:29.600
Gojou Satoru.

00:29.600 --> 00:32.090
I'm in charge of the 
first-years at Jujutsu Tech.

00:32.780 --> 00:34.450
Jujutsu...

00:34.450 --> 00:37.320
Fushiguro... Senpai!

00:41.400 --> 00:43.020
What is this?

00:45.200 --> 00:47.740
I'm not sure you should 
be worrying about others,

00:47.740 --> 00:49.520
Itadori Yuuji.

00:50.650 --> 00:54.110
It's been decided that you'll 
be secretly executed.

01:05.000 --> 01:11.960
Jujutsu Kaisen

02:25.520 --> 02:31.700
Episode 1: Ryoumen Sukuna

02:28.270 --> 02:31.700
Itadori

02:29.110 --> 02:30.660
Hello, Sugisawa Hospital.

02:30.000 --> 02:31.710
Oh, this is Itadori.

02:31.710 --> 02:33.110
I just called earlier.

02:33.580 --> 02:34.430
Yes.

02:34.810 --> 02:35.460
Yes.

02:35.460 --> 02:37.460
I'm sorry to keep calling,

02:37.460 --> 02:39.220
but how is my grandpa doing?

02:39.220 --> 02:42.250
Huh? I thought they already told you.

02:42.710 --> 02:44.540
Oh, please hold on.

02:44.540 --> 02:46.490
I'll go ask myself.

02:49.230 --> 02:52.040
Itadori-san never uses his call button.

02:52.040 --> 02:53.980
It's actually scary that he doesn't.

02:54.330 --> 02:56.980
Itadori-san, you have a phone call.

02:56.980 --> 02:58.950
Yuuji-kun's asking if you 
want him to bring any—

02:58.950 --> 03:00.200
Leave me alone!

03:00.200 --> 03:01.700
Tell him not to come!

03:01.700 --> 03:03.950
He should go to his club! His club!

03:06.200 --> 03:07.550
What? What's going on?

03:08.610 --> 03:09.980
You heard him.

03:09.980 --> 03:11.420
What club are you in, Yuuji-kun?

03:12.620 --> 03:13.890
I heard.

03:13.890 --> 03:16.210
I'll come by tomorrow evening.

03:19.240 --> 03:20.540
Miyashiro Prefectural Sugisawa Third High School

03:30.410 --> 03:33.580
They're keeping a cursed 
object in a place like this?

03:33.580 --> 03:35.020
Could they be any dumber?

03:47.950 --> 03:49.120
There's nothing here.

03:49.120 --> 03:50.030
Huh?

03:50.030 --> 03:52.100
The Stevenson screen's empty.

03:52.100 --> 03:54.270
For real? That's hilarious!

03:54.270 --> 03:55.770
Maybe it took a nighttime stroll.

03:55.770 --> 03:57.040
I'll punch you.

03:57.330 --> 04:00.370
Well, no going home 
until it's recovered, okay?

04:02.770 --> 04:05.010
I'm seriously going to punch him next time.

04:10.420 --> 04:11.810
Ready to go?

04:11.810 --> 04:13.770
Are you really sure,

04:11.830 --> 04:13.760
Occult Phenomenon
Research Club

04:14.230 --> 04:15.900
Sasaki-senpai?

04:16.320 --> 04:18.020
Iguchi-senpai?

04:18.400 --> 04:20.280
Okay, here we go!

04:20.280 --> 04:22.430
Spirits, spirits, please tell us...

04:22.430 --> 04:24.980
Which creature is the council 
president just barely weaker than?!

04:27.010 --> 04:27.900
Ku

04:27.310 --> 04:30.120
Ku-ri-o-ne (sea angel)?

04:28.010 --> 04:28.730
ri

04:28.830 --> 04:29.320
o

04:29.390 --> 04:30.110
ne

04:30.140 --> 04:32.940
Sea Angel

04:30.140 --> 04:32.940
A type of plankton
living in cold oceans!

04:30.140 --> 04:32.940
A transparent
body!

04:30.140 --> 04:32.940
It's actually
related
to mollusks!

04:30.140 --> 04:32.940
It moves its legs,
which look
like wings,
to float around.

04:30.140 --> 04:32.940
When capturing prey,
its mouth pops open
and shoots out tentacles!

04:30.140 --> 04:32.940
Eek!

04:30.250 --> 04:31.860
A sea angel can beat him?!

04:31.860 --> 04:33.410
What a small fry!

04:33.410 --> 04:34.720
Occult club!

04:34.720 --> 04:37.330
Hey, Plankton President! What's up?

04:37.560 --> 04:38.280
Notice

04:38.430 --> 04:40.580
As you were previously informed,

04:40.580 --> 04:43.540
a research club with no real activities 
must forfeit its club room.

04:43.540 --> 04:45.070
So vacate this room at once!

04:45.070 --> 04:49.350
You shouldn't underestimate 
our members, President.

04:49.780 --> 04:50.140
Mysterious Events
File 9

04:51.820 --> 04:53.150
What is that?

04:54.300 --> 04:57.440
You know about our rugby field 
being closed off, right?

04:57.820 --> 04:58.720
Yes.

04:58.720 --> 05:01.570
Some of the students who fell 
ill were actually hospitalized.

05:01.570 --> 05:03.490
Don't you think that's strange?

05:03.490 --> 05:05.700
We're talking about tough rugby players here.

05:06.340 --> 05:09.290
Truth is, the players said 
they started hearing

05:09.070 --> 05:10.280
B
i
n
g

05:10.280 --> 05:13.790
O
o
o
o
o

05:10.720 --> 05:13.790
mysterious sounds and voices 
right before they fell ill.

05:13.790 --> 05:17.250
That's when we found this newspaper 
article from thirty years ago.

05:17.100 --> 05:20.540
Belongings Found
on Roadside, 
Possible Crime

05:17.250 --> 05:20.790
It talks about the disappearance of Yoshida-san, 
who worked with the construction company,

05:17.290 --> 05:19.380
Former Employee, Age 35, Goes Missing at Sugisawa

05:17.290 --> 05:20.540
Former Employee of a
Major Construction Company
Never Made a Comeback
and Went Into Debt

05:20.790 --> 05:23.120
Last
Sighted
at
Sugisawa
Third

05:20.790 --> 05:23.120
Laid Off from Work
Failed to Start New Enterprise
Possible Suicide

05:20.790 --> 05:25.800
and it mentions he was last sighted here at 
Sugisawa Third High School during construction.

05:26.820 --> 05:29.010
Laid Off from Work
Failed to Start New Enterprise

05:27.140 --> 05:29.320
Yoshida-san was struggling to make ends meet,

05:28.890 --> 05:31.010
Continuous Collection Calls
Threatening Calls and Faxes

05:29.320 --> 05:30.760
so he turned to loan sharks

05:30.760 --> 05:32.810
and those organizations were after him.

05:30.890 --> 05:32.800
Suspicious Men at His Home
Possible Kidnapping

05:33.300 --> 05:34.320
Which means!

05:34.320 --> 05:37.480
The whole disaster at the 
rugby field was caused by

05:37.480 --> 05:40.810
the vengeful spirit of Yoshida-san, 
who's buried there!

05:39.210 --> 05:41.110
Vengeful Spirit

05:40.810 --> 05:43.320
No, it was caused by ticks.

05:41.110 --> 05:43.320
Vengeful Spirit

05:44.920 --> 05:52.190
Hard Ticks

05:44.920 --> 05:52.190
A large,
parasitic tick
that sucks the blood
of animals and humans!

05:44.920 --> 05:52.190
Be careful, because they can be carriers of
infectious diseases that lead to death if they bite humans!

05:44.920 --> 05:52.190
Diseases such as Severe Fever with Thrombocytopenia Syndrome (SFTS)

05:44.920 --> 05:52.190
Hmm?

05:44.920 --> 05:52.190
They leap onto targets
from grass and bushes.

05:44.920 --> 05:52.190
Burp

05:44.920 --> 05:52.190
Leap

05:44.920 --> 05:52.190
Size

05:44.920 --> 05:52.190
Before Blood

05:44.920 --> 05:52.190
After Blood

05:44.920 --> 05:52.190
After sucking blood, their size
can increase up to 100x!

05:45.210 --> 05:46.330
Hard ticks.

05:46.330 --> 05:48.200
A large, blood-sucking bug.

05:48.200 --> 05:51.140
If one bites you and infects you with SFTS,

05:51.140 --> 05:52.570
it can be fatal, so be very careful.

05:52.570 --> 05:53.920
So what?!

05:53.920 --> 05:56.330
The occult club is trying 
to uncover occult activity,

05:56.330 --> 05:58.080
so it's still a proper club activity report!

05:58.080 --> 06:00.230
This isn't some kid's game!

06:00.230 --> 06:01.760
Besides, the biggest problem is you,

06:01.760 --> 06:03.180
Itadori Yuuji!

06:03.180 --> 06:05.380
You're registered with track 
and field, not the occult club,

06:05.380 --> 06:10.050
so this club doesn't even have the 
three members required for any club!

06:08.490 --> 06:10.040
Not Enough Members

06:10.310 --> 06:10.970
Huh?

06:10.970 --> 06:12.430
Itadori...

06:12.430 --> 06:14.560
No, I know I wrote down the occult club.

06:14.560 --> 06:16.560
I rewrote it!

06:16.560 --> 06:18.990
The track and field coach, Takagi!

06:18.990 --> 06:21.940
Itadori, we need you so we 
can conquer the nationals!

06:22.600 --> 06:25.610
A teacher more problematic than 
the students just showed up...

06:26.170 --> 06:29.170
Give it a rest! How many times 
do I have to tell you I refuse?

06:29.170 --> 06:29.770
You can't!

06:29.770 --> 06:30.570
Why can't I?!

06:30.570 --> 06:32.620
However, I'm not some demon!

06:32.620 --> 06:34.990
If you can beat me, then I'll give up on you.

06:35.430 --> 06:38.500
Let's settle it fair and square on the track!

06:38.500 --> 06:39.900
Now it's interesting!

06:39.900 --> 06:41.650
You're on!

06:41.100 --> 06:47.840
Track and Field Coach

06:41.100 --> 06:47.840
Takagi

06:41.100 --> 06:47.840
Itadori

06:44.010 --> 06:47.470
Is it "fair and square" to rewrite 
a student's club application?

06:52.550 --> 06:54.910
What's with this rugby field?

06:57.470 --> 07:00.060
Is there a dead body 
buried here or something?

07:00.810 --> 07:01.980
Even if there is,

07:02.600 --> 07:04.620
I'm surprised to see one this high-leveled.

07:05.160 --> 07:07.060
That's probably a grade 2 curse.

07:07.640 --> 07:09.530
Must be that cursed object's influence.

07:11.550 --> 07:19.030
No Unauthorized Entry

07:11.750 --> 07:12.870
Damn it.

07:12.870 --> 07:15.160
Its presence is too strong to pin down.

07:15.160 --> 07:18.490
It feels like it's close by, 
but it could still be far away, too.

07:19.480 --> 07:22.290
This special-grade cursed 
object is a serious pain.

07:23.250 --> 07:25.090
Who could have moved it?

07:25.090 --> 07:26.610
Where is it now?

07:27.470 --> 07:28.870
Over here!

07:28.870 --> 07:32.250
Coach Takagi is taking on 
Itadori from West Middle!

07:32.250 --> 07:34.270
Wow, what are they competing in?

07:36.350 --> 07:37.750
Yeah!

07:38.720 --> 07:40.270
Fourteen meters!

07:40.370 --> 07:41.840
*Japan's National Record

07:41.850 --> 07:44.620
Wow, Takagi's still got it!

07:42.660 --> 07:54.320
Itadori! Itadori!

07:44.620 --> 07:46.080
What're you gonna do, Itadori?!

07:46.080 --> 07:48.130
Hey, is Itadori famous or something?

07:48.670 --> 07:51.590
They're probably tall tales, but I heard 
he beat all stages of Ninja Warrior,

07:51.590 --> 07:53.890
and that he's the reincarnation 
of Mirko Cro Cop.

07:54.730 --> 07:56.830
But Mirko's not even dead yet.

07:57.330 --> 07:59.890
Still, he earned the nickname 
"Tiger of West Middle."

07:59.890 --> 08:01.080
Lame.

08:01.080 --> 08:03.340
Hey, can I just throw this however I want?

08:03.340 --> 08:06.520
Yep. I won't call any fouls, 
so throw however you please.

08:06.520 --> 08:07.590
Sorry.

08:07.590 --> 08:09.950
I wanted to demonstrate how 
serious I am by intentionally

08:09.950 --> 08:12.050
choosing something that isn't your forte—

08:15.570 --> 08:19.060
Uh, roughly thirty meters.

08:16.570 --> 08:19.050
*World Record

08:19.060 --> 08:21.520
Yeah, I win!

08:21.520 --> 08:23.830
He's more gorilla than tiger, isn't he?

08:23.830 --> 08:25.520
That was a pitcher's throw.

08:26.160 --> 08:29.020
Itadori, you'd do well on a sports team.

08:29.490 --> 08:32.110
You don't have to force yourself to 
stay in our occult club, y'know.

08:32.110 --> 08:33.060
Huh?

08:33.060 --> 08:35.960
But as much as you two love scary things,

08:35.960 --> 08:38.990
you couldn't go to haunted 
places without me, could you?

08:36.470 --> 08:39.010
Shiver

08:36.470 --> 08:39.010
Tremble

08:36.470 --> 08:39.010
3 Days Ago

08:39.010 --> 08:40.620
We're scared because we like it.

08:40.620 --> 08:42.040
Yay!

08:40.920 --> 08:43.800
Besides, this school requires 
everyone to be in a club, right?

08:43.800 --> 08:45.250
I couldn't keep up with this.

08:45.250 --> 08:48.070
You don't have to do anything!
You can be a ghost member!

08:45.270 --> 08:50.240
Occult Phenomenon
Research Club

08:48.070 --> 08:49.540
We're the occult club, after all!

08:50.250 --> 08:51.760
I did say that.

08:51.760 --> 08:54.850
I want to be able to go home 
by 5 PM for my own reasons.

08:54.850 --> 08:56.760
So if it's okay with you, I'd like to stay.

08:57.250 --> 09:00.010
I like the atmosphere of 
the occult club a lot.

09:00.010 --> 09:02.520
Well, if that's how it is, we don't mind.

09:02.820 --> 09:03.740
Yeah.

09:04.840 --> 09:06.550
That guy's incredible.

09:06.550 --> 09:09.320
He pulled that off without any cursed energy.

09:09.320 --> 09:11.860
I wonder if he's like Zenin-senpai...

09:12.080 --> 09:14.790
Oh, it's already half past four!

09:14.790 --> 09:17.280
Well, Coach, I've got stuff to do! Later!

09:26.760 --> 09:28.440
The presence of a cursed object!

09:28.440 --> 09:29.210
Hey, you!

09:29.210 --> 09:31.400
He's way too fast!

09:31.400 --> 09:34.290
I heard he can run fifty 
meters in three seconds.

09:34.290 --> 09:35.720
Is he a car?

09:34.360 --> 09:35.710
*World Record
5.47s+

09:46.790 --> 09:49.260
Sugisawa Hospital

09:49.290 --> 09:51.260
Itadori

09:49.290 --> 09:51.260
Saitou

09:49.600 --> 09:51.270
I told you not to come.

09:51.690 --> 09:53.760
Stop buying flowers to bring 
with you all the time.

09:53.760 --> 09:55.200
You always give me that.

09:55.200 --> 09:58.240
Besides, these aren't for you. 
They're for the nurses.

09:58.240 --> 09:59.680
All the more reason not to, you fool!

09:59.680 --> 10:01.490
And what about your club?

10:01.490 --> 10:02.970
Go to your club! Your club!

10:02.970 --> 10:04.870
Oh, chill out.

10:04.870 --> 10:06.800
It ends before 5 PM.

10:06.800 --> 10:09.930
I wouldn't be visiting you 
if I didn't have the free time.

10:09.930 --> 10:11.130
Good.

10:11.130 --> 10:14.130
Then listen to me, since I've got free time, too.

10:14.130 --> 10:15.680
Not interested.

10:15.680 --> 10:17.180
Just listen well.

10:17.180 --> 10:19.930
There's something I want 
to tell you before the end.

10:19.930 --> 10:22.470
It's about your parents.

10:21.420 --> 10:24.140
I said I'm not interested.

10:24.580 --> 10:28.100
Grandpa, could stop trying to 
act all cool before you die?

10:28.100 --> 10:31.600
Every man wants to go out in style, you know!

10:31.600 --> 10:33.790
Get a clue, you useless grandson!

10:34.220 --> 10:36.070
Quit snapping over everything.

10:36.770 --> 10:38.640
You can just be yourself.

10:40.610 --> 10:42.850
Tsk. Lax upbringing.

10:49.200 --> 10:50.540
Yuuji.

10:50.540 --> 10:51.540
Hmm?

10:51.910 --> 10:54.790
You're a strong kid, so help others.

10:54.790 --> 10:58.900
Even if it's only those closest to you, 
just save the people you can.

10:58.900 --> 11:00.380
It's okay if you lose your way,

11:00.380 --> 11:03.140
and don't worry about whether 
they'll thank you or not.

11:03.550 --> 11:06.520
Just save as many people as you can, 
even if it's only one.

11:07.120 --> 11:10.530
When you die, you should 
be surrounded by people.

11:11.270 --> 11:13.570
Don't end up like me.

11:24.350 --> 11:25.520
Grandpa?

11:26.010 --> 11:27.940
Nurse Call

11:26.010 --> 11:27.940
Matsumoto

11:26.010 --> 11:27.940
Hanai

11:26.010 --> 11:27.940
Eguchi

11:26.010 --> 11:27.940
Akita

11:26.010 --> 11:27.940
Itadori

11:26.010 --> 11:27.940
Kosaka

11:28.510 --> 11:30.520
Yes, what's the matter?

11:32.800 --> 11:33.990
Hello?

11:33.990 --> 11:35.170
Itadori-san?!

11:38.440 --> 11:39.660
Hello?

11:42.200 --> 11:45.140
My grandpa... is dead.

12:07.600 --> 12:09.570
Notification of Death

12:11.130 --> 12:12.080
Okay.

12:12.080 --> 12:14.270
That's all of the necessary paperwork.

12:14.270 --> 12:16.620
Okay. Thank you for everything.

12:16.620 --> 12:18.340
Are you sure you're okay?

12:18.850 --> 12:22.330
Well, this is my first time dealing 
with something like this,

12:22.330 --> 12:24.800
so it doesn't feel real yet.

12:24.800 --> 12:29.510
Grandpa would snap if I kept 
moping around forever, though,

12:29.510 --> 12:31.890
so I'll just have to laugh as I roast him up.

12:31.890 --> 12:33.250
Phrasing!

12:35.350 --> 12:36.860
Itadori Yuuji, right?

12:38.560 --> 12:40.930
I'm Fushiguro from Jujutsu Tech.

12:40.930 --> 12:42.670
I'd like to have a word with you.

12:42.670 --> 12:43.360
Now.

12:43.770 --> 12:45.990
Um, I'm in mourning right now.

12:45.990 --> 12:47.620
Sorry, but there isn't time.

12:47.620 --> 12:50.310
The cursed object you 
possess is very dangerous.

12:50.310 --> 12:51.980
Hand it over to me right now.

12:51.980 --> 12:53.370
Cursed object?

12:53.730 --> 12:54.770
This.

12:55.760 --> 12:58.590
Oh, yeah, yeah. I found that.

12:58.590 --> 13:02.510
I don't mind either way, 
but my senpai took a liking to it.

13:02.510 --> 13:04.250
What do you mean, "dangerous"?

13:05.150 --> 13:07.800
The number of unexplained 
deaths and missing persons

13:07.800 --> 13:11.010
within Japan exceeds 
10,000 a year on average.

13:07.970 --> 13:08.720
4th-grade Girl Commits Suicide. Bullying Suspected.
Suicide Note Read, "They Told Me to Die."

13:09.040 --> 13:10.010
Head of Nursing Home in Mifune Ward Stabbed to Death.
Former Patient Unindicted Once Again

13:11.640 --> 13:14.540
Most of those are the result of curses.

13:15.290 --> 13:16.530
Curses?

13:16.530 --> 13:18.710
I don't care if you believe in them or not.

13:18.710 --> 13:20.020
They're real.

13:20.340 --> 13:21.530
I'll go on.

13:22.280 --> 13:26.030
Large pools of negative energy form especially 
easily in schools, hospitals, and so on.

13:26.030 --> 13:29.070
Hardship, regret, shame...

13:29.070 --> 13:32.060
The negative emotions of mankind 
become the source of curses.

13:32.540 --> 13:37.000
That's why most schools secretly keep a 
cursed object such as a protective talisman.

13:37.530 --> 13:39.500
The object you found is one of them.

13:39.500 --> 13:42.260
If it's protecting us, shouldn't 
we be grateful for it?

13:42.260 --> 13:43.630
Let me finish.

13:44.500 --> 13:46.820
Placing a cursed object of greater evil

13:46.820 --> 13:49.140
is a deadly poison that 
keeps other curses away.

13:49.630 --> 13:51.950
It's a bad practice that 
only claims to protect.

13:53.020 --> 13:55.570
Over the years, its seal weakens,

13:55.570 --> 13:59.520
and then it becomes bait to lure 
in and fatten up other curses.

14:00.890 --> 14:02.440
The object you found

14:02.830 --> 14:05.540
is a dangerous one, 
classified as special-grade.

14:05.540 --> 14:07.450
Hand it over before people start dying.

14:07.450 --> 14:10.510
Hey, I already said I don't mind that.

14:10.510 --> 14:12.000
So go tell it to my senpai.

14:13.060 --> 14:14.260
It's empty?

14:14.260 --> 14:17.050
I was just following the 
taint clinging to the box?!

14:19.300 --> 14:20.420
Where are the contents?!

14:20.420 --> 14:23.390
I already told you, my senpai... have it...

14:23.970 --> 14:24.970
What?

14:24.970 --> 14:29.050
Actually, they were talking about removing 
the talisman from it tonight at the school.

14:31.220 --> 14:33.750
What? Is that bad?

14:35.390 --> 14:37.390
It's worse than bad.

14:37.930 --> 14:40.530
They're going to die.

14:45.270 --> 14:46.910
I can't get it off.

14:46.910 --> 14:49.730
Did we really need to sneak in to do this?

14:49.730 --> 14:51.030
I'm turning on the lights.

14:51.030 --> 14:53.360
No! The atmosphere's important!

14:53.360 --> 14:56.280
Enjoying the thrill is in the 
spirit of the occult club, isn't it?

14:56.280 --> 14:58.650
It's not like anything's 
going to happen, anyway.

15:00.250 --> 15:01.550
Oh, it came off!

15:15.390 --> 15:17.350
A human finger?

15:17.950 --> 15:19.350
Is it real?

15:23.450 --> 15:24.540
Is this...

15:28.200 --> 15:29.520
What is this?

15:33.170 --> 15:35.450
Do talismans come off that easily?

15:35.450 --> 15:38.540
No, it's impossible for people 
who lack cursed energy.

15:39.110 --> 15:40.440
Normally.

15:40.940 --> 15:42.900
Go right! It's a shortcut!

15:42.900 --> 15:45.170
This time the object itself is too strong.

15:45.170 --> 15:48.230
The seal is ancient. 
It might as well be plain paper.

15:48.230 --> 15:52.300
I still don't get all this stuff about curses.

15:52.300 --> 15:53.530
Where are they?

15:53.530 --> 15:54.760
Fourth floor!

15:58.850 --> 16:00.800
What is this pressure?

16:00.800 --> 16:02.440
You stay here.

16:03.780 --> 16:05.150
I'm coming, too!

16:05.150 --> 16:06.440
It's dangerous, right?

16:06.440 --> 16:08.450
I've only known them a few months,

16:08.450 --> 16:10.440
but they're my friends. I can't just stand by!

16:12.360 --> 16:13.700
Stay here.

16:14.340 --> 16:17.070
Occult Phenomenon
Research Club

16:17.660 --> 16:24.000
What time is it?

16:25.130 --> 16:32.050
The hour hand is at eleven.

16:32.050 --> 16:34.080
What is that monster?

16:34.080 --> 16:35.810
S-Sasaki...

16:35.810 --> 16:38.770
Iguchi? Thank goodness! Where have you—

16:38.770 --> 16:41.920
Help me...

16:45.470 --> 16:48.070
What time is it?

16:48.430 --> 16:50.030
The curse has been unleashed!

16:50.030 --> 16:52.610
Its presence is still all over the place!

16:53.950 --> 16:55.410
Slurp, slurp.

16:55.410 --> 16:56.780
Out of the way!

16:57.300 --> 16:58.200
Demon Dogs!

17:04.710 --> 17:05.620
Slurp.

17:05.970 --> 17:07.300
You can eat it.

17:08.790 --> 17:12.320
Am I just going to wait 
here like he told me to?

17:12.780 --> 17:15.630
What am I so afraid of?

17:16.120 --> 17:18.220
They're going to die.

17:18.610 --> 17:19.890
That's right.

17:19.890 --> 17:21.980
I can sense death all the way out here.

17:21.980 --> 17:24.010
I'm afraid of dying.

17:24.010 --> 17:25.660
Was I afraid of it then?

17:25.660 --> 17:28.230
It didn't feel like I was, though.

17:28.840 --> 17:31.510
I didn't cry because I was scared.

17:31.510 --> 17:33.480
I was just a little sad.

17:34.090 --> 17:37.990
But my grandpa's death 
and the death I'm facing now...

17:38.460 --> 17:40.490
How are they any different?

17:41.240 --> 17:44.370
You're a strong kid, so help others.

17:50.260 --> 17:52.310
The curses are growing in number.

17:52.310 --> 17:53.390
They're close.

18:01.440 --> 18:02.470
Found them.

18:04.240 --> 18:06.140
He was short-tempered and stubborn.

18:06.470 --> 18:09.150
No one but me ever paid him a visit.

18:10.640 --> 18:13.020
"Don't end up like me," huh?

18:13.020 --> 18:14.650
That's true.

18:14.650 --> 18:17.860
Damn it! Is it trying to swallow her 
along with the cursed object?!

18:19.760 --> 18:20.820
I'm not gonna make it!

18:30.460 --> 18:31.540
Itadori!

18:31.870 --> 18:35.170
I think you had a proper death, Grandpa.

18:35.840 --> 18:37.510
But...

18:39.550 --> 18:41.080
This death...

18:43.250 --> 18:44.970
is wrong!

18:49.870 --> 18:51.370
So this is a curse?

18:51.370 --> 18:53.070
Not what I was expecting.

18:57.790 --> 19:00.320
I want to ask you what you're doing here,

19:00.320 --> 19:01.670
but good job.

19:01.670 --> 19:03.250
Why so haughty?

19:04.230 --> 19:07.450
By the way, what's that 
munching on the curse?

19:07.450 --> 19:08.990
My shikigami.

19:08.990 --> 19:10.790
You can see them, then?

19:10.790 --> 19:13.100
Normally a curse can't be seen.

19:13.100 --> 19:16.190
Not unless you're on the verge of 
death or in special places like this.

19:16.190 --> 19:18.070
Yeah, that makes sense.

19:18.070 --> 19:20.720
I've never seen a ghost or 
anything before tonight.

19:21.730 --> 19:23.720
You're not scared, are you?

19:23.720 --> 19:26.710
Well, I was scared for a bit.

19:26.710 --> 19:27.860
But did you know?

19:27.860 --> 19:29.690
People really can die.

19:29.690 --> 19:30.690
Huh?

19:31.050 --> 19:36.040
So I at least want the people 
I know to have proper deaths.

19:36.040 --> 19:38.540
Not that I really get it myself.

19:38.540 --> 19:39.390
Whoa.

19:39.390 --> 19:40.390
This it?

19:40.390 --> 19:41.400
Yeah.

19:41.400 --> 19:44.330
That's the special-grade cursed 
object, Ryoumen Sukuna's finger.

19:44.330 --> 19:46.630
It's a miracle it didn't get swallowed.

19:46.630 --> 19:48.050
Why would anything eat it?

19:48.050 --> 19:49.120
Does it taste good?

19:49.120 --> 19:49.960
Don't be stupid.

19:50.320 --> 19:52.440
You'd do it to gain stronger cursed energy.

19:52.440 --> 19:54.460
It's dangerous, so hand it over already.

19:54.660 --> 19:56.110
Sure, sure.

20:00.840 --> 20:01.800
Run!

20:11.200 --> 20:12.310
Fushiguro!

20:13.770 --> 20:14.770
Nue!

20:35.960 --> 20:39.440
Damn it, I can't think straight.

20:40.460 --> 20:41.750
Itadori!

20:41.750 --> 20:44.890
Why can't you understand 
to take those two and run?!

20:45.510 --> 20:47.980
You're in big trouble yourself!

20:52.060 --> 20:54.420
Only curses can exorcise other curses!

20:54.420 --> 20:55.690
You can't beat it!

20:55.690 --> 20:57.820
Is this the time to be saying that?!

20:57.820 --> 21:00.320
You're going to die at this rate!

21:01.680 --> 21:04.990
If I went home now, I'd be having nightmares!

21:04.990 --> 21:06.240
Besides,

21:09.540 --> 21:11.000
I have my own...

21:11.000 --> 21:13.000
Help others.

21:13.000 --> 21:15.780
...troublesome curse already!

21:25.880 --> 21:26.790
You idiot!

21:26.790 --> 21:29.350
Hand it over to me or you'll be eaten, too!

21:33.640 --> 21:34.990
Why would anything eat it?

21:34.990 --> 21:36.030
Does it taste good?

21:36.030 --> 21:37.310
Don't be stupid.

21:37.310 --> 21:39.400
You'd do it to gain stronger cursed energy.

21:42.490 --> 21:45.510
There is a way to save everyone!

21:45.510 --> 21:47.950
I just need some cursed energy, 
right, Fushiguro?!

21:49.020 --> 21:49.950
Don't!

21:50.300 --> 21:51.380
Don't do it!

21:52.980 --> 21:54.730
Ryoumen Sukuna's finger!

21:54.730 --> 21:56.380
That's a special-grade cursed object!

21:56.380 --> 21:58.790
It's a deadly poison! He'll die for sure!

21:58.790 --> 22:01.370
But there's a one in a million...

22:01.980 --> 22:03.300
a one in a million chance...

22:43.710 --> 22:45.550
Ah, I knew it!

22:45.550 --> 22:48.630
The light feels best in the flesh!

22:49.440 --> 22:50.680
This is the worst!

22:50.680 --> 22:52.600
A one-in-a-million-chance,
worst-case outcome!

22:52.990 --> 22:55.570
The special-grade cursed 
object has incarnated!

22:55.570 --> 22:57.990
A cursed spirit's flesh is so boring.

22:57.990 --> 23:00.980
Where are the people? The women?!

23:01.820 --> 23:04.580
What a wonderful era to be in.

23:04.580 --> 23:08.550
Women and children are crawling 
everywhere like maggots.

23:08.550 --> 23:10.800
Marvelous!

23:10.800 --> 23:12.560
It'll be a massacre!

23:18.270 --> 23:20.390
What do you think you're doing with my body?

23:20.390 --> 23:21.380
Give it back.

23:21.380 --> 23:23.880
How are you able to move?

23:23.880 --> 23:26.420
I mean, it's my body.

23:27.600 --> 23:29.510
He's suppressing me?

23:30.120 --> 23:30.880
Don't move.

23:31.490 --> 23:33.600
You're no longer human.

23:35.980 --> 23:39.180
Under Jujutsu regulations, Itadori Yuuji,

23:40.050 --> 23:43.540
I will exorcise you as a curse!

23:52.030 --> 23:55.650
Episode 2:

For Myself

23:55.670 --> 23:57.670
>>>>oakislandtk<<<<<
